 <kevin.remondiere@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:48:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 54/54] strixhalo-verified: production runtime of 30/09/2026
 (agent loop speed + state correctness)

- recurrent state: per-slot rollback planes (upstream #28123) and host-side zeroing of the
  state row of a new sequence (the Vulkan graph optimizer ordered the read before the zero fill)
- MTP drafting hygiene: reset of the pending hidden state at sequence start (upstream #28333),
  draft stops at end-of-generation, per-request draft parameters, reuse of an identical context
  checkpoint instead of reading the state back again
- Vulkan: streaming loads (MOVNTDQA) for CPU reads of device memory (GGML_VK_STREAM_READ=0
  disables them)
- sampling: grammar fast path (rejection sampling with a single-token check before any
  full-vocabulary grammar pass; LLAMA_GRAMMAR_FASTPATH=0 disables it)

